{"vo",file="fem_szd_001253",ch="szd"},
},
ja={
{
name={"Shizuku"},
"“Fufuh, *chu*, *rerorerureru*... nmmmm, *shpp*, *shpp*, *shpp*... *smack*,\n*smack*, *smack*... *rerorero*... ah, se siente tan bien... Jaa, jaa,\nhaaah...”",
